ず、内心葛藤を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この優柔不断な性格が林檎をイラつかせることもあるが、基本的には保護者的な存在として頼りにされてもいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"精治から見れば、『苛められるために生まれてきたような女』である。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91271"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/7886f40df3a19c098aeb5711748a5d0138ee27e9d850a29f7ce7729def365213.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f6a29fb25f7cf785281b4872ec7e4e6fc510b22e12a67d91a53f1c781f278bfe.webp","width":113,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高城みつ","creatorId":"vndb:s29","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29","name":"高城 みつ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41608:91271:6469:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c99571","characterName":"清水 夢","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"91272","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41608"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17828"],"vndbCharacterId":"c99571"},"originalCharacterName":"清水 夢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“平野織枝”とコンクールに参加した帰りに「満潮」の乗車。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若くて健康的な魅力に溢れた少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸は普通だが、全体のスタイルは美しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目に反して頑固な性格。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17828","sourceWorkId":"11004","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"有名私立校の女子学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"軽音楽部に所属しており、夏休み中に他県のバンドコンクールに参加した帰り、同じ部活の織枝と共に 『せっかくだから旅行して帰ろう』といって特急【満潮】に乗り込んだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若々しく健康的で、礼儀正しい女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見すると、歳の割には落ち着きのある人間に見えるが、友人とはしゃぐ様は、歳相応のかわいらしさを感じさせる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目に反して頑固な性格で、一度言い出したら聞かない辺りに精神的な若さが見え隠れする。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91272"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f58ea90b3da4c91b88dc6dfd34f66dd66319a65a03a8dc2f915d1114ea5a79fe.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2b26e6378c3ce1db79c5b726fe0b00d0dcd68eba281880ca054820f47b128f42.webp","width":112,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高橋かな","creatorId":"vndb:s280","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s280","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s280","name":"藤森 ゆき奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41608:91272:6016:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c99572","characterName":"平野 織枝","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"91273","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41608"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17829"],"vndbCharacterId":"c99572"},"originalCharacterName":"平野 織枝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“夢”の親友で同級生。軽音楽部所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夢と共に「満潮」に乗り込む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あけっぴろげで裏がない性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほっそりとした体つき。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性的なことに対して、未経験ながら話題にすることに抵抗感が少ない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17829","sourceWorkId":"11004","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"夢の同級生で、親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほっそりとした身体つきの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とっつきやすい性格だが、悪く言えば馴れ馴れしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格が少々キツく口も悪いが、思ったことをすぐ口にしてしまうというだけで、逆に言えばあまり裏がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"友人思いの少女で、夢のことをとても大事にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"チャキチャキしていていつも落ち着きがない辺り、見た目的には夢と正反対の印象を受ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし性的な意識に関しては夢より大人で、経験はないものの、あまりそういった話題や行為に対して抵抗感を持ってはいない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91273"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/670acd65c0fd3f061a64d1ab5a80863d65f2cce7500699141c22711191b16406.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e2dcbe2c2453c66e5594267a7df62aff07d03bbebb6f491dee5815b8891606a.webp","width":116,"height":255,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水口まつり","creatorId":"vndb:s879","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s879","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s879","name":"水口 まつり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41608:91273:6380:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c99578","characterName":"四橋 理沙","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"91274","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41608"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17830"],"vndbCharacterId":"c99578"},"originalCharacterName":"四橋 理沙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"休暇に「満潮」を利用している美人女医。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アメリカ人とのハーフで、グラマラスな肉体。圧倒的なバスト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女医としてのプライドが高く、人を見下すような雰囲気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は無口。時として口を開くと毒のある一言を放つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"酒に酔うとスキができて、口数が増える。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17830","sourceWorkId":"11004","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【夜鷹】に常務する女医。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翔子と同じく【満潮】の運行中に捕らわれ、調教を受けて精治のメス奴隷の一員となる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17830","sourceWorkId":"35509","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"若くて有能な日米ハーフの美人女医。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"圧倒的かつ攻撃的なバストの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美人だが目つきや表情が鋭く、近寄りがたい雰囲気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常にプライドが高く、どこか他人を見下しているような節がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は無口で、たまに口を開くとキツイ一言を漏らすため、常時機嫌が悪いように見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アルコールの摂取等、気が緩むきっかけがあれば途端に口数が増え、愚痴や自慢話を始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家は裕福な家で、いつも高価な貴金属を身に付けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただしそれを見せびらかすような低俗なファッションセンスではない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91274"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/63bf0cdd1df5f72f4a0bfd9faaaf0a0a77d8cb08979c14dbe6366aa57eab5f3e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/899f62b33f7d284dc30710873310f76bc49773b8d80f3ce1132149359254ce40.webp","width":108,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅井晴美","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"浅井 晴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41608:91274:6131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c99580","characterName":"戎 希美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"91276","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41608"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17831"],"vndbCharacterId":"c99580"},"originalCharacterName":"戎 希美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"お好み焼き屋の家の一人娘。バスケ部所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家業を継がせて貰えないことに憤慨して家出。気晴らしに「満潮」に乗る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"活発な浪花っ子で、体育会系のノリ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし女の子らしい一面があり、乙女チックな妄想が止まらないことも……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17831","sourceWorkId":"11004","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"お好み焼き屋の一人娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お好み焼きだけでなく、料理は基本的に上手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『女だから』という理由で家業を継がせてくれない父親に反発して家を飛び出す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生き生きとした活発な娘で、見るからに浪花っ娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自然と身についたボケツッコミが、日常会話からも溢れ出る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見ボーイッシュだが、実際にはかなり女の子らしい内面を持っていて、意外と乙女チックな妄想をしていたりもする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引き締まったしなやかな肉体美を持つ、健康的な女の子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91276"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb496ef81d3b894791a54ba69536170bf709761b2fc432df03f60d8c1ff59e79.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/880bc672ea01c6c09f94309e475f0851afc97ff0c43c87afa3220a0d2384708b.webp","width":120,"height":254,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大垣理香","creatorId":"vndb:s2986","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2986","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2986","name":"大垣 理香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41608:91276:19056:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c99581","characterName":"長居 久美子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"91277","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41608"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17832"],"vndbCharacterId":"c99581"},"originalCharacterName":"長居 久美子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に母親を亡くした、父娘過程の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夏休みの家族旅行で父親と「満潮」に乗り込む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は帽子をかぶっていて、男の子みたい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意地っ張りで生意気な態度をとるが、本当は照れ屋ではずかしがり。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17832","sourceWorkId":"11004","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"夏休みを利用した家族旅行のため、父親と共に【満潮】に乗り込んだ小柄な少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親を早くに亡くしているため、普段は父親と二人暮しである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は髪をまとめて帽子を被っており、一見すると少年のようにも見えるが、実際はかわいらしい女の子である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その反面意地っ張りで口の悪いところがあり、生意気に見られることも多いが、それは母親のいない環境から無意識に『自分がしっかりしなければ』という決意が表れているためである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当は照れ屋で恥ずかしがり。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91277"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f7b27c1465b52f5c515acac6e686207ca06013aaf21ea22509760b4e7ab4c0a3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/740a295a11d88cf074ef2a8943db83345e61c2bf668c9e3a42ff4462c2adb4e3.webp","width":130,"height":235,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"竹間千ノ美","creatorId":"vndb:s574","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s574","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s574","name":"緒田 マリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41608:91277:19333:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c99582","characterName":"扇町 翔子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"91278","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41608"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17833"],"vndbCharacterId":"c99582"},"originalCharacterName":"扇町 翔子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"鉄道捜査隊の女性捜査官。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「満潮」と連続女性失踪事件の関係を嗅ぎ付け、捜査のため乗り込む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"正義感のかたまりの、警察官の鑑。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ性格が荒いため、気配りがきかず、なりふり構わず突進する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体の線は細いが、意外と強い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17833","sourceWorkId":"11004","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元鉄道捜査官。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当時【満潮】で起こる不可解な失踪事件の調査のために乗り込んできたが、精治に捕らわれ調教を受け、メス奴隷となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【夜鷹】の警備主任として乗車している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17833","sourceWorkId":"35509","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"鉄道捜査隊の女性捜査官。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性失踪事件と【満潮】の関係に目を付け、上層部からの圧力にも屈せず単身調査に乗り込んでくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"正義感の強い女性で、己の信念を曲げようとしない性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"困っている人は見捨てておけない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし持ち前の強気な性格のせいか、細やかな配慮や気配りができない傾向にあり、時折弱者を傷つける言動を知らずに発してしまったりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"細身の割りにそこそこ腕が立つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意志の強そうな顔立ちが特徴の美人である。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91278"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/edb12e79bdd051e0374894750c1d3b3bef525179a7aa5eb5a958de1449886821.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da73d7aaebb684c0f8fd03f3ac2d1c357474c90876ee66649f329b098bbed679.webp","width":122,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"稲田佳乃香","creatorId":"vndb:s1659","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1659","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1659","name":"稲田 佳乃香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41608:91278:6593:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p465","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2451","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p465","name":"つるみく","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:11004:2451","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p465","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p465","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p465","name":"つるみく","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:13958:v1007","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p465","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p465","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p465","name":"つるみく","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:163395:v1007","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p465","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p465","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p465","name":"つるみく","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"s